{"title":"The Emberfang's Heart","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level — Unclassified that attacks with unknown (unknown).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\">Special: Captured live by the research collector; no matching static client definition was in the bundled database.</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 1 looted corpse recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 1 recorded drop, 203 total, 203 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×203</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"ember-core\" title=\"Ember Core - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 3 total, 3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/f51fcc7dea071d81fbeb.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ember Core</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×3</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"thorn-feet\" title=\"Thorn Feet - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/c545c7eb5d27184e604d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thorn Feet</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"thorn-torso\" title=\"Thorn Torso - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/9f21d42474f8d7e3fe4d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thorn Torso</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>The Molten Heart</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 29</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"6305\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Unclassified: <a href=\"#/monster/frost-drake\">Frost Drake</a> <span class=\"muted\">(—)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/dryback\">Dryback</a> <span class=\"muted\">(—)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/old-ashbelly\">Old Ashbelly</a> <span class=\"muted\">(—)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/426ab568dfee249dffaa.svg\" alt=\"The Emberfang&#39;s Heart\"></div><h3>The Emberfang&#39;s Heart</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>— <span class=\"muted\">(seen 0–65)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Unclassified</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>unknown · unknown</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>—</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>—</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>—</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack range</th><td>—</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No (below level 10)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>S